WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.780
That’s one of the things we talked about
with Soli it’s a sort of magical sensor.

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.260
Baratunde: I did it!

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.000
I touched without touching!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.590
Leo: Then of course, we really need to test
to distinguish between intentional and unintentional

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.590
gestures.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.940
Just because I wave on top of the device...

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:11.940
Baratunde: Yes

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:12.940
Leo: Doesn’t mean I want to skip a song.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.530
Leo: If I pick up coffee cup, this gesture
is very similar to a swipe, and this is really

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.530
important.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:19.530
Baratunde: Ok

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.530
Leo: And then I can do this

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:21.530
Baratunde: Whoa

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.530
Leo: And it actually works

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.530
Baratunde: Hmmm

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.379
Leo: With Soli we can try to understand more
about the implicit behavior that happens around

00:00:26.379 --> 00:00:27.379
the device.

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:29.440
Baratunde: The phone knows earlier what your
intention is.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.440
Leo: Exactly.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.570
Let’s say the alarm goes off.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.570
SFX: Phone beeping

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:33.570
Leo: Really annoying.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.570
Baratunde: Yep

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.570
Leo: As you reach, we can lower the volume.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.570
Baratunde: Ahhhh

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.570
Leo: The phone is more polite.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.530
And then you can just go gesture to shut it
off.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.530
Baratunde: Laughing

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:44.310
Leo: This moment of understanding each other
happens all the time between us.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.770
But it never happened with technology.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:50.000
What we can do with radar is to actually capture
aspects of non-verbal communication.
